 "remarks": "Welcome to this bright and sun-filled 3-bedroom, 4-bath townhome offering 1,465 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space. Featuring hardwood floors, elegant crown molding, central air, and quality finishes throughout, this home offers the perfect combination of comfort and style. The updated kitchen is equipped with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and direct access to a private terrace-ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing. A flexible office/sunroom provides the perfect space to work from home or unwind, while the finished lower level adds valuable living space that can be customized to fit your needs. The spacious primary suite features a private en-suite bath and its own balcony, creating a comfortable retreat at the end of the day. Outside, enjoy a private outdoor area along with parking for up to three vehicles. Please note: The photos shown are of the adjacent mirror-image unit. Finishes and layout are substantially similar",
